[{"id":"919812708115058688","date":1508135413000,"rawContent":"Me too - it's my pinned tweet. \n\n#MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920128800419131392","date":1508210775000,"rawContent":"@annabethgish Thank you for sharing your story. You are a \"beautiful girl\" - a 10 in my heart. My #rape story is my pinned tweet. #MeToo xo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920412359486791686","date":1508278381000,"rawContent":"\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47WATCH THIS #DonaldTrump #TheResistance #SexualAssault #Sexism #RapeCulture #WarOnWomen #MeToo #Workplace https:\/\/t.co\/eRaeCP78Ey","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929973453289132033","date":1510557923000,"rawContent":"@BettyBuckley Once I began \"talking\" - which was years ago I never really stopped. But it's so commonplace where I'm from no one \"listened\" or \"cared\" - always yeah #MeToo - it just seems like people are \"actually listening\" now. If that makes sense. #ThankYou","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929975538592206849","date":1510558421000,"rawContent":"Where I live, a small community, people. don't. care. It's common. It's routine. It happens. It's not normal. But it is normal. It's normal for this community to shrug and say yeah it happens to all girls here. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929976196993028097","date":1510558578000,"rawContent":"When I tell anyone the identity of the man who raped me it's ALWAYS the same reaction. Oh him. Yeah totally. He's a fuck. He raped so and so or he molested so and so also. Shake their head, shrug, take a drag off their cigarette. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929976634601562112","date":1510558682000,"rawContent":"As far as I know, this man has been taken to court (not by me, certainly) but most of his victims have remained silent. No one believes us; no one cares - one of the two. I'm not \"important\" on his rung of victims. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929977894176264192","date":1510558982000,"rawContent":"And yes, this happened to me nearly 40yrs ago now. My story isn't gonna hold a cup of water against this man. It's a 4yr old's 40yr old recount against a man's word. Nothing else. No witnesses. I'd not be doing myself any favors at all. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929978500471316480","date":1510559127000,"rawContent":"I was 22yrs old the last time I laid eyes on my rapist. That's nearly 20yrs ago. I remember he stared through me with cold, black eyes. I know he knew exactly what he'd done. I felt he'd do it again if chance presented itself. I was scared of him. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929979053616058369","date":1510559259000,"rawContent":"It's tremendously difficult to maintain an accusation against anyone for anything when your entire familial circle doesn't believe your story; rather they believe his. I must be lying. My cousins must be lying. We're all lying. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929979677472710656","date":1510559407000,"rawContent":"This thread goes along with my pinned thread; I've tweeted a bit more and a bit more about my own story as more allegations of assault and abuse have unearthed, frankly. And I'm mad at myself. Mad at my family. Mad at the world. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929980147951947776","date":1510559520000,"rawContent":"I've carried my #rape story around like a hump on my back for nearly 40 goddamn years. It's always a shadow just round the corner you know?? Always there. Never too far out of thought or range. My. whole. life. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":12.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929980795745423360","date":1510559674000,"rawContent":"So, candidly, to finally be given a \"voice\" - a \"forum\" like Twitter - where I can say whatever I want about what happened to me; yeah, I'm gonna use it. People online are the only people who've ever listened to me about anything. Frankly. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929981302215970816","date":1510559795000,"rawContent":"And it's not really about whether anyone is even reading this; though I hope they are. It's about the fact that I can place it here. He's not here. He's not on Twitter. I'd be shocked. He's not an educated man. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929981961262780417","date":1510559952000,"rawContent":"If I'd to lay money down I bet my rapist doesn't even know my name. He might know my first. And it's all the same sort who block me on FB for being \"blue\" or #LGBT who defend &amp; believe him. Over me. Fuck them. #MeToo","media":null,"username":"MsDarcyFarrow","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"929982485928259584","date":1510560077000,"rawContent":"It's all I can do to NOT type this man's name down. How freeing 